#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "None known as of iptables-1.2.1 release"
msgstr "Aucun bogue connu au moment de la distribution iptables-1.2.1."

