#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Andras Kis-Szabo E<lt>kisza@sch.bme.huE<gt> contributed ip6tables-restore."
msgstr ""
